Purpose:
Module ke andar available lessons ka MongoDB structure define karta hai.

Fields:

moduleId → Lesson kis Module se belong karta hai uski reference.
title → Lesson ka title.
content → Lesson ka actual learning content.
order → Module ke andar lesson ka sequence.
duration → Lesson complete karne ka estimated time in minutes.
isPublished → Lesson published hai ya nahi.
timestamps → createdAt aur updatedAt automatically generate karta hai.
moduleId
moduleId: {
  type: mongoose.Schema.Types.ObjectId,
  ref: "Module",
  required: true,
}

Ye Module collection ke _id ko reference karta hai.